{"additions":120,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Problem\nWhile reading a diff on the Git page, the view suddenly jumps back to the top.\n\nAny change under the repository (build output, an editor swap file, another tool touching `.git/index`, …) re-fetches the diff, and `on_files_changed` reset the scroll position to 0 even when the same file stayed selected.\n\n## Fix\n- Keep the scroll position and cursor when the previously selected file is still selected after a refresh (`rebind_file`); only a different file starts at the top\n- The render clamps a kept scroll position / cursor row to the refreshed content in case the diff got shorter\n- Invalidate the `content_lines` cache on refresh (it was keyed by path only and did not follow content changes)\n\n## Tests\n- A refresh with the same file selected keeps scroll / cursor\n- A refresh where the selected file disappears starts at the top\n\nNo UI / keybinding change (no tape update).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":3,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:12Z","deletions":3,"headRefName":"fix/diff-scroll-kept-on-refresh","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvLA","name":"bug","description":"Something isn't working","color":"d73a4a"}],"number":194,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABP7Ve6w","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nCursor clamping occurs after rendering has already used the stale position.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** 1 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Open (1)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Clamp cursor before rebuilding selection and rendered lines](#discussion_r4142662976) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nPreserves Git diff navigation state across filesystem-triggered refreshes.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Rebinds unchanged file selections without resetting scroll state.\n- Invalidates refreshed diff caches and clamps stale positions.\n- Adds refresh-selection regression tests.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `src/​git/​state.rs` | Preserves selection state and adds tests. |\r\n| `src/​git/​panes/​diff_view/​mod.rs` | Adds refresh-aware rebinding and cache invalidation. |\r\n| `src/​git/​panes/​diff_view/​view.rs` | Clamps retained positions after content changes. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-30T08:47:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"9a81166cc5921a718b28603579f99a641d8fd973"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:35Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36695284414/job/109821692141","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:40Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:49:54Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683052/job/109810108388","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:46:43Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683044/job/109810108186","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:48:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683052/job/109810108298","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:22Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:51:19Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683052/job/109810108093","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:24Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:51:19Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683052/job/109812149990","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:51:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:35Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36695284414/job/109821657266","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:35Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:47:51Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683044/job/109810107886","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:20Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T08:47:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36691683044/job/109810108208","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-30T08:45:23Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:35Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/36695284414/job/109821658326","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-09-30T09:18:35Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"🐛 Keep the diff view's scroll position across filesystem refreshes"}
